{"version":1,"content":"<p>深圳下月18日至19日即將舉行亞太經合組織（APEC）會議。</p><p>據《南方都市報》報道，深圳消防救援局星期天（10月25日）發布開展重要會議期間全市消防安全夜查行動的通告，每晚展開「全市消防安全夜查行動」，涉及城中村、賓館飯店、歌舞娛樂等場所。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:31.013558+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T07:10:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T09:38:15.486888+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:04.602332+00:00","content_hash":"8a33bd39c3f8ce72fd83c77b5f1a8fbe76aa7e4a1edd826e62e82d74d12b061e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}